mat.\n\nI need to structure each of the 22 planned experiments with name, plan_id, description, expected results as a metrics dictionary, rationale for why those results occurred, which tables they feed into, figure descriptions, and analysis of what the results mean. Some experiments like datagen and setup are infrastructure-focused rather than training-focused, so I'll keep their metric reporting lighter. The grid_b_low_eval will stay as a separate entry since the plan lists it that way, though I'll provide aggregate analysis across related experiments.\n\nBuilding the YAML structure...\n\nFor the best tier prediction, I need to account for the fact that only Llama cross-generator testing is actually planned, not the full set mentioned in the assumptions. Looking at the existing batch-level b* distribution where about 20-25% of batches fall below the b=0.5 optimal region while the median sits around 0.87, the adaptive mechanism should handle this by letting individual batches with high contamination use higher b values while others stay lower, creating an effective distribution that covers the region well.\n\nNow I'm examining the performance curve more carefully — the data shows b=0.5 achieves the best PPL at 17.651, with b=0 and b=1.0 both performing worse at around 17.69-17.70. This suggests a sharp minimum near b=0.5, so I need to predict how performance degrades as b moves away from that sweet spot in either direction. The quadratic model overshoots at b=1.0, so the actual curve is probably more complex. I'll just set reasonable interpolated values for the intermediate points across all three seeds, with seed123 showing the deepest minimum and the others following similar patterns with slightly shallower valleys.\n\nSince b=0.3 and b=0.5 are within noise margins across all seeds, the plateau region is ambiguous—I could report either as grid-best, though b=0.5 is the more conservative choice for the paper. The key insight is that this plateau supports using an adaptive approach rather than a fixed value.\n\nNow I need to think through the 60% contamination case and how the b* distribution behaves there before writing out the YAML configuration. there's more synthetic data. The detector scores would have:\n- 60% samples with high q-score (synthetic) vs 40% at current\n- The q-score distribution shifts: more mass at high q\n\nWith more contaminated samples per batch, the α_eff calculation would push b* higher because:\n- Higher contamination → need stronger downweighting\n- The batch-level statistics (mean q, variance, etc.) reflect the higher contamination\n- b* naturally increases to maintain ESS constraint with more contaminated samples\n\nSo b* median shifting from 0.87 (40%) to ~1.4 (60%) is plausible.\n\nFor 3B model, I need to reconsider: the b* calculation depends only on q-score statistics from the detector, not on model-specific loss dynamics. Since both models use the same TF-IDF detector and contamination rate, they should produce the same b* distribution regardless of model size. The only way b* would differ is if the data shuffling or batch composition changes, but that shouldn't happen with the same seed and data.\n\nSo the b* distributions should be nearly identical between 0.6B and 3B at the same contamination rate. The difference in PPL impact comes from how the 3B model responds to the same downweighting scheme—it might benefit more or less depending on its capacity and training dynamics.\n\nBut wait, the batch size constraint changes things. At 0.6B I'm working with batch_size=16, which gives me 200M tokens across 6103 steps. At 3B with batch_size=4 due to memory limits, the q-score statistics become noisier within each batch, and the ESS constraint (n_min=2) becomes tighter—requiring at least 50% effective samples. This pushes b* toward more conservative values, probably around 0.6-0.7 instead of 0.87. Though if gradient accumulation keeps the effective batch size at 16, the dynamics might stay similar while total steps quadruple to ~24000. The real question is whether the same b* values actually produce larger PPL improvements on the 3B model compared to 0.6B.\n\nActually, thinking about this more cleanly: if I maintain effective batch size at 16 through gradient accumulation, then the b* distribution should be nearly identical to 0.6B since it's derived from the same data and detector. The key difference would just be that the 3B model benefits more from the same adaptive b* values, which supports the \"zero-cost, principled\" framing. So I'd expect b* mean around 1.40 and median around 0.87, showing the method works consistently across model scales. The one thing I haven't figured out yet is what the grid-best b value would be for 3B, since the experiment plan only includes adaptive b*.\n\nBut actually, that's the whole point—I'm not running a grid search on 3B at all. The advantage is demonstrating that adaptive b works without needing per-model tuning, so I can just note that Drayson found b=1 optimal for 1.7B and we'd expect something similar for 3B, but we don't need to verify it. Now I need to organize the experiments sequentially and figure out what tables and figures to include—starting with an extended grid-b curve across multiple seeds and then contamination scaling results. Now I'm moving on to write out the YAML configuration. I need to be thorough here since I'm specifying all the planned experiments—the P0, P1, and P2 sections that haven't been executed yet, while the MVP experiments are already complete with their registry IDs. Let me structure this by experiment tier and make sure each one has clear rationale without being overly verbose. I need to be precise about the `p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5` experiment—it's testing only b=0.5 at 60% contamination to demonstrate that the optimal b value from 40% doesn't transfer. For the training loss predictions, I'm accounting for how weighted training affects the loss values differently across contamination levels, so at 60% with higher contamination, the weighting scheme will shift the loss landscape further. I'm realizing I should focus on eval_ppl as the primary metric rather than getting caught up in train_loss variations across different configurations. Now I'm going to write out the YAML results, making sure to include specific PPL values with proper precision, explain how each result connects to the underlying assumptions, and describe what tables and figures this experiment will contribute to the paper narrative.\n\nBefore I finalize this, let me verify my contamination calculations make sense from first principles. At 40% contamination with b=0.5, the synthetic samples get weighted around 0.39 while real samples get weighted around 0.92, giving a ratio of roughly 0.42. At 60% contamination with the same downweighting parameter, the proportion of synthetic samples increases but the per-sample weighting mechanism stays consistent.\n\nWhen I increase b to 1.5 at 60% contamination, the weighting becomes much more aggressive—synthetic samples drop to about 0.058 while real samples stay around 0.78. This makes sense because with more contamination, I need stronger filtering. For the PPL prediction, uniform weighting at 60% contamination means training on mostly synthetic data with noise, while the grid-best approach with optimal b downweights the synthetic heavily enough that the model trains primarily on real data, keeping PPL similar to the clean baseline.\n\nNow looking at the actual PPL numbers, the degradation from contamination appears slightly super-linear—going from 40% to 60% contamination increases the PPL gap from about 0.24 to 0.47 points. With grid-best reweighting at 60%, I can't fully recover the clean PPL since the effective training data shrinks, but the 80 million tokens of real data that remain should still be substantial enough to keep PPL around 17.75, which is better than the uniform 60% case even if not quite as good as the 40% reweighted version.\n\nThe adaptive approach performs slightly better here because the higher contamination naturally pushes the reweighting parameter higher, letting it adapt more aggressively. The improvement ratio between adaptive and grid-best at 60% contamination is about 1.12x, and when I look at how the amplification scales from 40% to 60% contamination, the grid-best improvement grows roughly 4x larger—which aligns with my earlier estimates of a 3-5x amplification range.\n\nNow I'm checking what happens if I stick with the b=0.5 parameter that was optimal at 40% contamination. At 60%, that's too conservative and misses the new optimal around b=1.5, giving worse performance than the adaptive approach. This confirms that the optimal reweighting parameter shifts significantly with contamination level.\n\nI'm ready to structure the YAML output now, organizing each experiment with its name, plan ID, description, specific metric predictions, and results.\n\nFor the narrative, I need to document which paper tables and figures each experiment supports, then write the analysis that ties everything together. The key story here is that adaptive b* not only matches the grid-search baseline without requiring tuning, but actually exceeds it in most settings. The trajectory of b* shifts predictably with contamination rate and model scale, giving us direct evidence for the theoretical framework. The amplification factors directly address reviewer concerns about effect size, and we can confidently claim this approach is principled, zero-cost, and effective.\n\nNow I'm consolidating the related experiments—keeping the three grid_b_low seeds separate as planned but noting their connections. The post-hoc evaluation at p0_grid_b_low_eval will aggregate results across all nine checkpoints, so I'll predict consolidated numbers there rather than individual runs.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9839,"cache_read_input_tokens":27185,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9839},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50e25480-ff86-4d52-8ac3-d97b90843ba0","uuid":"ea4f8c7c-44cb-4a8b-8a9f-1e4794bdcf32"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Xr1ntACNyZbzYPgvVifdau","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reading the experiment plan for all planned experiments.\n\nNow let me generate the comprehensive best-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Adaptive b* 不仅免调参匹配 grid-best，在多数设置下达到或超过 grid-best。\n  b* 轨迹随污染率/模型规模自适应偏移，证明 α_eff(b) 框架捕捉了正确的统计量。\n  Claim 2 可升级为 \"adaptive matches or exceeds grid-best\"，\n  Claim 1 的理论框架有 b*-tracks-optimum 的直接证据支撑。\n  效应放大数据直接回应 \"small effect size\" 的 reviewer concern。\n  论文可正面 claim: principled, zero-cost, and effective。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.1: b<0.5 Grid Extension\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed42\n    description: \"在 b=0.5 以下扩展 grid 搜索，确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外。seed42。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.681\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.668\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.654\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.42\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.95\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.1 极其温和的 downweighting 仅比 uniform (17.690) 好 0.009 PPL——大部分合成样本权重仍接近 1.0，几乎无过滤效果。\n      b=0.2 改善至 17.668，因为 w=(1-q)^0.2 对高 q 值样本（synthetic, q≈0.85）的权重降至 (0.15)^0.2≈0.72，开始起效但幅度不足。\n      b=0.3 达到 17.654，与 b=0.5 的 17.651 仅差 0.003，因为在 TF-IDF detector 的 q-score 分布下（bimodal, 中间区域占 46%），\n      b=0.3-0.5 区间的有效样本量 ESS 和 α_eff 都在最优平台内。\n      train_loss 逐步上升因为更高 b 对 contaminated samples 的 loss contribution 压缩更多。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds — seed42 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (b-PPL curve): b=0.1/0.2/0.3 扩展 seed42 曲线左侧，确认 broad minimum 在 b∈[0.3,0.5]\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed42 的 b=0.3 与 b=0.5 差距仅 0.003 PPL，远小于 seed variance (~0.01)。\n      证实 b=0.5 不是边界伪影，最优区间是宽阔的 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed123\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed123，验证跨 seed 一致性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.674\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.656\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.641\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.43\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.96\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.29\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed123 在 MVP 中一贯表现最优（grid-best b=0.5 PPL=17.638 最低），因其随机初始化恰好对 data quality 信号更敏感。\n      b=0.3 的 17.641 与 b=0.5 的 17.638 仅差 0.003，同样在 seed variance 内。\n      与 seed42 一致地确认最优平台而非单一最优点。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed123 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed123 曲线叠加，三条曲线在 b∈[0.3,0.5] 重合验证平台稳定性\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨 seed 一致性：seed123 的 b=0.3 同样在平台内，最优区间 cross-seed 稳定。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed456\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed456，完成 3-seed b<0.5 曲线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.684\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.670\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.653\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.40\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.93\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.26\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed456 在 MVP 中 uniform PPL 略高 (17.700)，对应更大的改善空间。\n      b=0.3 的 17.653 与 b=0.5 的 17.650 仅差 0.003，第三次独立确认 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n      所有三个 seed 的 b=0.3 vs b=0.5 差异一致地小于 seed variance (σ≈0.008)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed456 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed456 曲线完成三 seed 覆盖\"\n    analysis: >\n      3/3 seeds 确认 b=0.3 和 b=0.5 在噪声范围内无显著差异，消除 boundary concern。\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_eval\n    description: \"对 9 个 b<0.5 训练 checkpoint 统一进行 holdout 评估，获取可比的 eval_ppl。\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_9_eval_ppl_collected: true\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_1: 17.680\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_2: 17.665\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_3: 17.649\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_5: 17.646\n      cross_seed_std_b0_3: 0.007\n      cross_seed_std_b0_5: 0.007\n      b0_3_vs_b0_5_paired_t_pvalue: 0.42\n      updated_finer_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      finer_grid_best_b_note: \"b=0.3 within seed variance; b=0.5 retained as grid-best\"\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      统一 post-hoc eval 消除训练时评估条件差异。跨 seed 平均后 b=0.3 (17.649) 与 b=0.5 (17.646) 差异仅 0.003，\n      paired t-test p=0.42 远不显著。这确认 grid-best 仍为 b=0.5（或更准确地说，b∈[0.3,0.5] 是一个无显著差异的最优平台）。\n      关键发现是曲线形态：b=0→0.3 单调下降，b=0.3→0.5 平台，b=0.5→1.0 急剧上升。\n      这种不对称性（慢进快出）解释了为什么 adaptive b* 的 median=0.87 仍然有效——b 偏高 0.4 的 PPL 代价远小于偏低 0.4 的代价。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: 完整 extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds — 汇总行\"\n      - \"Table 2 注脚: paired t-test b=0.3 vs b=0.5, p=0.42 (n.s.)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: 完整 b-PPL 曲线（9 个新数据点 + 18 个 MVP 数据点），标注 [0.3,0.5] 平台区域和 adaptive b* 分布直方图叠加\"\n      - \"Figure 2 inset: 放大 b∈[0,1] 区域的曲线形态，标注 asymmetric penalty structure\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 boundary concern 已完全消除。最优区间是 [0.3, 0.5] 宽平台。\n      adaptive b* 的 p25=0.54 恰好落在平台右沿，56% 的 per-batch b* 在 [0.3, 1.5] 区间。\n      结合不对称 penalty structure（偏高 < 偏低的代价），adaptive 的 median=0.87 是合理的保守选择。\n      论文可表述为 \"grid-best is not a single point but a plateau spanning b∈[0.3, 0.5]; adaptive b* allocates the majority of its mass in or near this region.\"\n      更新 aggregate ratio（使用 b=0.5 作为 grid-best，维持 88.6%——finer grid 不改变此数字因为 b=0.5 仍为 grid-best）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.2: 60% Contamination\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6 (Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_datagen\n    description: \"生成 60% 污染率的训练数据集，并用 TF-IDF+LR detector 进行评分。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scored_data_ready: true\n      contamination_ratio_actual: 0.60\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      q_score_mean: 0.68\n      q_score_std: 0.35\n      q_score_median: 0.78\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.41\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.936\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染率意味着更多高 q-score 样本。q_score_mean 从 40% 的 0.60 升至 0.68，median 从 0.707 升至 0.78，\n      因为 synthetic 样本占比增大推高了分布的上半部分。\n      detector AUC 略降至 0.936（vs 40% 的 0.939），因为 60% 意味着 class imbalance 从 40:60 变为 60:40，\n      TF-IDF 在 prevalence shift 下 AUC 微降但仍 >0.93。\n      mid_range_ratio (q∈[0.2,0.8]) 从 0.463 降至 0.41，因为更多样本被推向高 q 区域。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score 分布对比图 (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)，标注 median 和 mean shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据质量验证：60% 的 q-score 分布如预期偏移，detector 在不同 prevalence 下保持 AUC >0.93。\n      mid_range 比例下降意味着更多样本的 contamination status 是明确的（高 q 或低 q），\n      有利于 adaptive b* 的 α_eff 估计精度。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_uniform\n    description: \"60% 污染率下的 uniform 基线，作为效应放大的参考点。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.92\n      eval_loss: 2.886\n      train_loss: 7.48\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12000\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      从 40% (17.690) 到 60% uniform PPL 上升至 17.92 (+0.23 PPL, +1.3%)。\n      更多合成数据意味着 60% 的梯度来自被 generate model 统计特性扭曲的文本，\n      累积的分布偏移导致 model 对 clean holdout distribution 的拟合退化。\n      上升幅度非线性：40% 时 PPL 比 clean (~17.45 估计) 高 0.24，60% 时高 0.47。\n      这符合 strong model collapse 文献的预测——污染效应超线性增长。\n      train_loss 略高于 40% 的 7.31 因为合成数据的 loss landscape 更平坦。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Contamination scaling (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6) — Uniform 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Contamination rate vs PPL bar chart — uniform 系列\"\n    analysis: >\n      60% uniform PPL 比 40% 差 0.23 PPL，确认 contamination 对模型质量的负面影响随比例非线性增大。\n      这为 effect amplification argument 建立了必要的 baseline gap。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_adaptive\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 adaptive b*，验证效应放大 + b* 轨迹追踪。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.73\n      eval_loss: 2.875\n      train_loss: 7.92\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 11500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.19\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 1.06\n      effect_amplification_vs_40pct: 4.75\n      b_star_mean: 2.08\n      b_star_median: 1.42\n      b_star_std: 2.45\n      b_star_p25: 0.82\n      b_star_p75: 2.55\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 12.3\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 24.8\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 32.1\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 30.8\n      ratio_vs_grid_b0_5: 111.8\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      核心结果：PPL 从 17.92 (uniform) 降至 17.73，改善 0.19 PPL (1.06% relative)。\n      对比 40% 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%)，效应放大 4.75x——在 [3, 5] 的 best 档范围内。\n\n      效应放大的因果链：\n      1) 60% 污染 → 每个 batch 中 ~60% 样本需要 downweight（vs 40%）\n      2) 更多 contaminated samples → α_eff(b) 的 Pareto tail 更重 → b* 自然上调以维持 ESS\n      3) 更高 b* → 对 synthetic samples 的 gradient contribution 压缩更彻底\n      4) 有效训练信号中 clean data 占比提高 → holdout PPL 改善更大\n\n      b* 分布右移：median 从 0.87 (40%) 升至 1.42 (60%)，mean 从 1.40 升至 2.08。\n      这是 b*-tracks-optimum 的直接证据——当 contamination 增加时，adaptive 框架自动推高 b* 以匹配新的最优区域。\n      p25 从 0.54 升至 0.82 意味着即使最低四分位也不再落在 40% 的最优平台 [0.3, 0.5] 内，\n      而是适应性地转向 60% 的更高最优区间。\n\n      ratio_vs_grid_b0_5 = 111.8%：adaptive 的 0.19 PPL 改善超过 grid b=0.5 在 60% 下的预期改善 (0.10)。\n      这是因为 b=0.5 在 60% 下已不再最优——contamination 增加要求更高的 b，\n      而 adaptive 自动追踪到了更优的 b 区间，grid b=0.5 做不到。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Contamination scaling — Adaptive 行\"\n      - \"Table 4: b* distribution summary across settings (40% vs 60%)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Effect amplification — adaptive 改善量 bar，标注 4.75x amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution histograms side-by-side (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)，标注 median shift 0.87→1.42\"\n      - \"Figure 5: b* trajectory over training steps at ρ=0.6，与 ρ=0.4 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 best 档的核心证据之一。两个关键 takeaway：\n      (1) Effect amplification 4.75x 直接回应 \"small effect size\" 的 reviewer concern——\n      0.3% → 1.06% 的 relative improvement 在 60% 条件下已不再 \"small\"，且趋势表明更高污染下价值更大。\n      (2) b* median shift 从 0.87 到 1.42 是 α_eff(b) 框架 captured the right statistics 的硬证据。\n      b* 不是固定的超参数——它是数据驱动的自适应量，且其自适应方向与 grid-optimal shift 一致。\n      这支撑 Claim 1（理论框架有效性）和 Claim 2 的升级（\"matches or exceeds\"）。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\n    description: \"用 40% 最优的 b=0.5 在 60% 下运行，展示 fixed-b 在 contamination shift 下的退化。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.83\n      eval_loss: 2.881\n      train_loss: 9.72\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.09\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.50\n      ratio_of_60_vs_40_improvement: 2.25\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 污染下仍优于 uniform (17.83 vs 17.92, 改善 0.09 PPL)，但改善量仅为\n      adaptive 在同条件下 (0.19 PPL) 的 47%。\n\n      原因：b=0.5 在 60% 下 \"太温和\"。对 synthetic samples (q≈0.85)，w=(1-0.85)^0.5≈0.39，\n      这在 40% 污染时足够（只需轻度过滤 40% 的数据），但在 60% 污染时不够——\n      60% 的梯度仍有 39% 的权重，过滤力度不足。\n      grid-optimal 在 60% 约为 b=1.5（对应 w=(0.15)^1.5≈0.058，几乎完全过滤 synthetic gradient）。\n\n      这个实验的价值在于直接展示 fixed-b 跨条件迁移的失败：\n      40% 的 grid-best 不是 60% 的 grid-best。\n      如果使用 Drayson 的 validation-based b 选择，需要在 60% 条件下重新做 grid search。\n      Adaptive b* 自动处理了这个迁移。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Contamination scaling — Grid b=0.5 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: bar chart 中 grid b=0.5 在 60% 下的 bar 显著低于 adaptive\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 adaptive vs fixed-b 对比的关键证据。b=0.5 在 40% 是最优的，在 60% 沦为次优。\n      adaptive b* 无需 re-tuning 就适应了新条件。\n      论文表述：\"\"A fixed b tuned for one contamination level does not transfer; adaptive b* adapts automatically.\"\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.3: Cross-Model (Llama-3.2-3B)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_setup\n    description: \"下载 Llama-3.2-3B，生成 detector scores，准备训练数据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_downloaded: true\n      model_params_B: 3.21\n      vram_usage_estimate_GB: 72\n      gradient_checkpointing_needed: true\n      effective_batch_size: 16\n      micro_batch_size: 4\n      gradient_accumulation_steps: 4\n      detector_scores_reused: true\n      detector_note: \"Same TF-IDF+LR detector scores (text-based, model-agnostic)\"\n      setup_gpu_hours: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-3B 约 3.2B 参数，FP16 下占 ~6.4GB 模型权重，但训练时 optimizer states + gradients + activations\n      需要 ~65-72GB。4× RTX 6000 Pro 96GB 可用 DDP，单卡 batch_size=4 + gradient_accumulation=4\n      达到 effective batch_size=16（与 0.6B 一致，保证可比性）。\n\n      TF-IDF+LR detector scores 可复用——detector 基于文本特征（词频 + 逻辑回归），\n      与训练模型架构无关。这也符合 Claim 3 (unknown proportion) 的设定。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      环境就绪。关键设计决策：保持 effective batch_size=16 以确保 b* 分布可直接与 0.6B 对比。\n      gradient checkpointing 增加约 20% 训练时间但不影响收敛。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_uniform\n    description: \"3B 模型的 uniform 基线。预期比 0.6B 低得多的 PPL（更强模型）。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.85\n      eval_loss: 2.554\n      train_loss: 5.89\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 38000\n      gpu_hours: 11.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型在 200M tokens 上训练后 holdout PPL 约 12.85——显著低于 0.6B 的 17.69。\n      PPL 降低来自更大的模型容量：更多参数可以更好地建模语言分布。\n      但 40% synthetic contamination 仍在拖累：clean 3B PPL 估计约 12.50，\n      contamination 导致 0.35 PPL degradation (~2.7%)——比 0.6B 的 1.4% degradation 更大，\n      因为 3B 模型有更多参数来\"记忆\"合成数据的 distributional artifacts。\n\n      train_runtime 约 38000s (10.5h)：3B 的每步计算量约为 0.6B 的 5.3x，\n      但 gradient checkpointing 的 recompute 增加约 20% overhead。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: Cross-model results (Qwen3-0.6B vs Llama-3.2-3B) — Uniform 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: Cross-model comparison bar chart — uniform baselines\"\n    analysis: >\n      3B uniform PPL 12.85 确立了 cross-model 基线。\n      contamination degradation 比例 (2.7%) 大于 0.6B (1.4%)，预示 reweighting 的效益更大。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_adaptive\n    description: \"3B 模型上的 adaptive b*——验证跨模型规模泛化 + 效应放大。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.69\n      eval_loss: 2.541\n      train_loss: 6.12\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 39500\n      gpu_hours: 12.0\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.16\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 1.24\n      effect_amplification_vs_06B: 5.39\n      b_star_mean: 1.41\n      b_star_median: 0.88\n      b_star_std: 1.97\n      b_star_p25: 0.54\n      b_star_p75: 1.53\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 20.8\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 35.6\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 27.4\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 16.2\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 0.16 (12.85→12.69, 1.24% relative)——是 0.6B 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%) 的 5.4x 放大。\n\n      效应放大的机制：\n      (1) 3B 的更大容量使其对 data quality 更敏感——更多参数 = 更精细地适配训练分布，\n      因此 clean vs contaminated distribution 的差异被放大\n      (2) 3B 在 contaminated samples 上学到更强的 spurious patterns（更高的 memorization capacity），\n      reweighting 的去除效果更显著\n      (3) clean data 的信号在 3B 上被更充分地利用（0.6B 可能 capacity-bound，无法完全受益于更干净的梯度）\n\n      b* 分布几乎与 0.6B 完全一致（median 0.88 vs 0.87, mean 1.41 vs 1.40）——\n      这是因为 b* 仅从 per-batch q-score 统计量推导，与模型架构/规模无关。\n      同一数据 + 同一 detector + 同一 batch composition = 同一 b*。\n      但同样的 b* 在 3B 上产生更大的 PPL 改善——b* 的 universal applicability 是最强的 selling point。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: Cross-model results — Adaptive 行\"\n      - \"Table 4: b* distribution summary — Llama-3.2-3B 列（与 Qwen3-0.6B 并列）\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: Cross-model bar chart — adaptive bars 标注 5.4x amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution overlay (0.6B vs 3B)——几乎完全重合，标注 KL divergence ≈ 0\"\n      - \"Figure 7: Scatter plot — model size vs relative PPL improvement, 标注 scaling trend\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个层面的强证据：\n      (1) 效应放大 5.4x 彻底回应 \"small effect size\"——1.24% relative PPL improvement on 3B is substantial\n      (2) b* 分布跨模型规模完全一致——证明方法是 model-agnostic，b* 是数据属性而非模型属性\n      (3) 无需 per-model validation——Drayson 在 1.7B 用 b=1 vs ≤360M 用 b=10，需要 per-model tuning；\n      我们的 adaptive b* 跨 0.6B 和 3B 自动给出一致且有效的值\n\n      Claim 2 在 3B 上的 ratio 计算：\n      若 grid-best for 3B 也约 b=0.5 (同一数据)，grid-best PPL ≈ 12.71，\n      则 ratio = (12.85-12.69)/(12.85-12.71) = 0.16/0.14 = 114.3%。\n      Adaptive 超过 grid-best——因为 per-batch b* 在高 contamination batches 用更高 b，\n      在 clean batches 用低 b，优于任何 fixed b。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.4: n_min Sensitivity\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_1\n    description: \"极松的 ESS 约束 (n_min=1)——允许 b* 过高，可能 over-downweight。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.668\n      eval_loss: 2.873\n      train_loss: 7.85\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10400\n      b_star_mean: 2.95\n      b_star_median: 1.73\n      b_star_std: 3.82\n      b_star_p25: 0.71\n      b_star_p75: 3.45\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 12.8\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 允许 ESS 降至 1（即一个 batch 中理论上只需 1 个有效样本）。\n      这释放了 b* 的上限约束——α_eff(b) 的最大化不再受 ESS 限制，b* 可以飙到很高值。\n\n      结果是 b* 分布大幅右移：median 1.73 (vs n_min=2 的 0.87)，12.8% 的 batches b*>5。\n      在这些高 b* batches 中，几乎所有 contaminated samples 权重趋近于零，\n      有效只有 1-2 个 clean samples 贡献梯度——gradient variance 极高。\n\n      PPL 17.668：比 n_min=2 的 17.650 差 0.018，但仍优于 uniform 17.690 (改善 0.022)。\n      方法没有彻底崩溃，因为多数 batches 的 b* 仍在合理范围 (p25=0.71)，\n      只有极端 batches 出问题。这说明 n_min 在保护方法稳定性上是必要但阈值不需精确。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: n_min sensitivity ablation (n_min = 1, 2, 3, 4, 5)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: n_min vs eval_ppl curve — n_min=1 点标注 'over-aggressive'\"\n      - \"Figure 8 inset: b* distribution comparison across n_min values\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 验证了 ESS 约束的必要性：无约束下 b* 过高导致 gradient variance 增大，\n      PPL 退化但不崩溃 (仍优于 uniform)。\n      这支持 n_min=2 作为 sweet spot 的选择——既足够宽松允许有效 downweighting，\n      又足够紧来防止极端 over-filtering。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_4\n    description: \"n_min=batch_size → ESS 约束要求所有样本保持有效 → b* 被强制为 0。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.873\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      当 n_min = batch_size = 4 时（micro-batch for DDP, per-GPU），ESS 约束要求\n      每个 batch 的有效样本量 ≥ batch_size。由于 ESS 定义为 (Σw_i)²/Σw_i²，\n      对于 w=(1-q)^b，任何 b>0 都会降低 contaminated samples 的权重，\n      从而使 ESS < batch_size。因此 b* 被强制钳制为 0。\n\n      PPL = 17.690，与 uniform (17.690) 完全一致——验证了当 ESS 约束完全绑定时\n      算法正确退化为 uniform training。train_loss 也与 uniform 一致 (7.31)。\n\n      这是一个 sanity check：证明 adaptive b* 的改善确实来自非零的 b*（即 reweighting），\n      而非算法实现中的其他副作用（如 batch shuffling, gradient scaling 等）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: n_min sensitivity — n_min=4 行，标注 '=uniform'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: n_min=4 点与 uniform baseline 重合\"\n    analysis: >\n      完美的退化验证。n_min=4 → b*=0 → uniform，PPL 精确匹配。\n      这排除了任何 confounding factor，确认改善纯粹来自 adaptive reweighting signal。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_5\n    description: \"n_min > batch_size 的退化情况。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.873\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4，ESS 约束不可能被满足（ESS 上限为 batch_size=4 < n_min=5），\n      因此 b* 始终被钳制为 0。结果与 n_min=4 完全相同——uniform training。\n\n      这是 boundary case 验证。n_min > batch_size 在实践中没有意义，\n      但作为 ablation 的一端提供完整的 sensitivity curve。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: n_min sensitivity — n_min=5 行，标注 'degenerate'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: n_min=5 与 n_min=4 重合在 uniform baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      与 n_min=4 一致的退化行为。完整 ablation 展示清晰的 phase transition：\n      n_min=1 (over-aggressive) → n_min=2 (optimal) → n_min=3 (fragile, seed-dependent) → n_min≥4 (degenerate/uniform)。\n      结合 MVP 已有数据 (n_min=2: 17.650, n_min=3: 17.690 for seed42)，\n      sensitivity curve 有 4 个有效数据点 + 1 个 degenerate 确认。\n      n_min=2 是唯一稳定工作的值——但这不是 \"another hyperparameter to tune\"，\n      而是一个有明确物理含义的约束（\"每 batch 至少 2 个有效样本\"），\n      且 robustness window 为 n_min∈{1,2}（两个值都 > uniform）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: ENHANCE PAPER\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_modernbert\n    description: \"训练高 AUC detector (ModernBERT-150M) 并生成训练集的 q-scores。\"\n    expected_results:\n      detector_auc: 0.986\n      detector_accuracy: 0.961\n      detector_ece_calibrated: 0.022\n      temperature_T: 0.85\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.40\n      q_score_median: 0.72\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.28\n      training_gpu_hours: 1.8\n      scoring_gpu_hours: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT (150M params) 的 AUC 达 0.986（vs TF-IDF 的 0.939），\n      因为 transformer 可以捕捉 n-gram 之外的语义一致性和 generation artifacts。\n      calibrated ECE 0.022 (vs TF-IDF 0.048) 因为模型输出 logit 的温度校准更精确。\n\n      关键差异在 q-score 分布：mid_range_ratio 仅 0.28 (vs TF-IDF 0.463)。\n      ModernBERT 将更多样本推向极端（要么 q≈0 (confident real) 要么 q≈1 (confident synthetic)），\n      中间地带大幅缩小。这意味着 w=(1-q)^b 的权重更接近 binary (0 or 1)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Detector comparison (TF-IDF+LR vs ModernBERT)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Figure: q-score 分布对比 (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)——ModernBERT 更 bimodal\"\n    analysis: >\n      ModernBERT 的更高 AUC 和更 bimodal 的 q-score 分布将显著改变 b* 的行为。\n      mid_range_ratio 降至 0.28 意味着 adaptive b* 的空间被压缩——\n      多数样本的 (1-q)^b 对 b 的敏感度降低（接近 0 或 1）。\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_ablation_training\n    description: \"用 ModernBERT q-scores 训练 adaptive + uniform，量化 detector quality → PPL 关系。\"\n    expected_results:\n      modernbert_adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.638\n      modernbert_uniform_eval_ppl: 17.690\n      modernbert_adaptive_improvement: 0.052\n      modernbert_adaptive_relative_pct: 0.29\n      tfidf_adaptive_improvement: 0.040\n      improvement_ratio_modernbert_vs_tfidf: 1.30\n      modernbert_b_star_mean: 0.82\n      modernbert_b_star_median: 0.45\n      modernbert_b_star_std: 1.15\n      modernbert_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      modernbert_grid_best_ppl: 17.634\n      modernbert_adaptive_ratio: 96.3\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高 AUC detector → 更精确的 q-scores → 更准确的 reweighting → 更低的 PPL。\n      ModernBERT adaptive PPL 17.638 vs TF-IDF adaptive 17.650，改善 0.012 PPL。\n      相对改善量从 0.040 (TF-IDF) 增至 0.052 (ModernBERT)，提升 30%。\n\n      但关键 finding 是：这个 30% 提升对应 AUC 从 0.939 到 0.986 的差距 (0.047 AUC)，\n      边际收益递减。TF-IDF (AUC=0.939) 已捕获了大部分 reweighting value。\n\n      b* 分布因 q-score 更 bimodal 而更窄更低：median 0.45 (vs TF-IDF 0.87)。\n      这是因为 ModernBERT 的 q 值更极端，(1-q)^b 的权重区分在低 b 就已足够。\n      adaptive 框架自动适应了 detector 质量的差异——这本身就是 adaptivity 的体现。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Detector quality ablation — 训练结果列\"\n      - \"Table 4: b* distribution — ModernBERT 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 9: Detector AUC vs PPL improvement scatter/bar chart\"\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distributions under different detectors (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two findings for paper:\n      (1) Lightweight detector sufficiency：TF-IDF+LR (AUC=0.939) 已实现 77% 的 ModernBERT (AUC=0.986) reweighting value，\n      但成本仅为后者的 1/100（CPU 训练 vs GPU 微调 150M transformer）。\n      (2) Adaptive b* detector-agnostic：方法在两种截然不同的 detector 下都有效工作，\n      b* 分布自动适应 q-score 分布特性。\n      这强化了 Claim 1（方法的 principled nature）和实用性论证。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_datagen\n    description: \"用不同模型家族生成合成数据，测试 cross-generator robustness。\"\n    expected_results:\n      generator_model: \"Llama-3.2-1B\"\n      training_model: \"Qwen3-0.6B\"\n      contamination_ratio: 0.4\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      detector_auc_cross_gen: 0.952\n      detector_accuracy_cross_gen: 0.873\n      q_score_mean: 0.62\n      q_score_std: 0.38\n      q_score_median: 0.73\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.44\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 7.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B 生成的 synthetic text 与 Qwen3-0.6B 生成的有不同的 stylistic signatures。\n      TF-IDF+LR detector 在 cross-generator 场景下 AUC 提高至 0.952 (vs same-generator 0.939)——\n      因为跨模型族的 generation artifacts 更容易被 n-gram 特征区分\n      （Llama 和 Qwen 有不同的 tokenizer、训练数据、生成模式）。\n\n      q-score 分布略有不同：mean 0.62 (vs 0.60)，median 0.73 (vs 0.707)。\n      Llama 生成的文本被检测器更 confidently 识别为 synthetic，对应稍高的 q 值。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score distribution comparison (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-generator 数据准备就绪。detector 在 cross-generator 场景下自然表现更好，\n      因为跨模型族的 artifacts 差异更大。这是一个 favorable setup，\n      但也反映了 real-world 场景（web corpus 含多个生成器的输出）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_training\n    description: \"用 Llama 生成的 contaminated data 训练 Qwen3-0.6B，测试 adaptive 跨生成器鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      cross_gen_uniform_ppl: 17.72\n      cross_gen_adaptive_ppl: 17.67\n      cross_gen_improvement: 0.05\n      cross_gen_relative_pct: 0.28\n      cross_gen_b_star_mean: 1.32\n      cross_gen_b_star_median: 0.83\n      cross_gen_b_star_std: 1.86\n      same_gen_improvement_for_ref: 0.04\n      cross_gen_vs_same_gen_ratio: 1.25\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-generator contamination 的 uniform PPL (17.72) 比 same-generator (17.69) 略高——\n      Llama-generated text 的 distributional distance 与 Qwen training 的 mismatch 更大。\n\n      Adaptive 改善 0.05 PPL (0.28% relative)，与 same-generator 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%) 相当甚至略好。\n      改善略大因为 cross-generator 的 contamination 更容易检测 (AUC=0.952 vs 0.939)，\n      q-scores 更 discriminative → reweighting 更精确。\n\n      b* 分布与 same-generator 高度一致 (median 0.83 vs 0.87)，\n      证明 adaptive 框架不依赖于特定生成器的 q-score 特征。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Cross-generator results (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution comparison (same-gen vs cross-gen)——高度重合\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive b* 在跨生成器场景下稳定工作，改善量与 same-generator 一致。\n      这验证了 Claim 3 的扩展：方法不仅不需要已知污染比例，\n      也不需要知道 contamination 来源模型——只需 detector scores 即可。\n      论文可以表述为 \"generator-agnostic: adaptive works regardless of the source of synthetic contamination.\"\n\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_detect_remove\n    description: \"硬阈值过滤 baseline——q>0.5 的样本直接丢弃。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.668\n      eval_loss: 2.8725\n      train_loss: 6.85\n      total_steps: 3540\n      retained_data_fraction: 0.537\n      retained_tokens: 107400000\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.022\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.12\n      improvement_fraction_of_adaptive: 0.55\n      gpu_hours: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      q>0.5 阈值移除 46.3% 的数据（mid_range + high-q 部分）。\n      仅保留 53.7% 的训练 token (~107M)，total_steps 从 6103 降至 ~3540。\n\n      PPL 17.668——优于 uniform (17.690, -0.022) 但逊于 adaptive (17.650, 差 +0.018)。\n      改善量仅为 adaptive 的 55%。\n\n      原因有二：\n      (1) 数据损失：detector 不完美 (AUC=0.939)，mid_range 中有大量 clean-but-borderline 样本被错误移除。\n      移除 46% 数据意味着训练集有效缩减近半，loss of coverage 影响 language model 的 distributional coverage。\n      (2) 丧失细粒度：hard threshold 是 binary 决策，而 adaptive reweighting 保留了 gradient-level 的连续控制。\n      q=0.48 (刚好保留) 和 q=0.52 (刚好移除) 的样本被处理方式截然不同，但其实它们的 contamination 概率差异极小。\n\n      train_loss 低于其他方法因为数据更干净（移除了大部分 noisy samples）但数据量也更少。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Baseline comparison (uniform, grid-best, adaptive, detect-remove, random-reweight)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Baseline comparison bar chart — detect-and-remove 标注 data loss penalty\"\n    analysis: >\n      Detect-and-remove 的 0.12% PPL 改善仅为 adaptive 的 55%，\n      清晰展示 soft reweighting 优于 hard filtering。\n      关键 insight：在 imperfect detector 下 (AUC<1.0)，\n      连续权重比二元决策更能容忍检测误差。\n      This directly supports the \"loss reweighting > SIR resampling\" positioning vs Drayson。\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_random_reweight\n    description: \"随机权重 baseline——验证 detector signal 是 load-bearing 的。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      eval_loss: 2.874\n      train_loss: 7.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10400\n      ppl_vs_uniform: -0.005\n      ppl_vs_adaptive: -0.045\n      random_weight_mean: 0.5\n      random_weight_std: 0.29\n      gpu_hours: 3.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重 (i.i.d. uniform [0,1]) 不含任何 contamination signal。\n      PPL 17.695 与 uniform 17.690 几乎无差异 (差 0.005, <0.03% relative)——\n      随机噪声在 expectation 上等价于 uniform weighting，仅增加少量 gradient variance。\n\n      微弱的退化 (0.005 PPL 劣于 uniform) 来自随机权重引入的 gradient variance：\n      高权重 batch 和低权重 batch 的 loss 贡献不均衡，增加了 optimization 的随机性。\n      但效应极小，证明 reweighting 本身不有害（只要权重均值合理）。\n\n      与 adaptive 的 0.045 PPL 差距证明：adaptive 的改善 100% 来自 detector-informed weighting，\n      不是来自 \"任何形式的 reweighting 都有帮助\" 的偏见。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Baseline comparison — Random reweight 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Random reweight bar 与 uniform 重合，凸显 adaptive 的 detector-driven gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      最清晰的 ablation 之一：random reweight ≈ uniform → detector signal 是必要条件。\n      adaptive 的改善不是来自 \"diversity of weights\" 或 \"regularization effect\"，\n      而是精准地识别和 downweight contaminated samples。\n      论文必须 include 此 baseline 以消除 trivial explanation。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: IF GPU BUDGET ALLOWS\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p2_domain_skewed\n    description: \"合成数据集中注入 code/technical 域，测试 adaptive 在非均匀域分布下的鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      contamination_distribution: \"70% code, 20% technical/science, 10% general\"\n      uniform_eval_ppl: 17.73\n      adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.68\n      adaptive_improvement: 0.05\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.28\n      b_star_mean: 1.52\n      b_star_median: 0.95\n      b_star_std: 2.12\n      b_star_per_domain_code_median: 1.35\n      b_star_per_domain_general_median: 0.42\n      gpu_hours: 6.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-skewed contamination（70% code）使 uniform PPL 比 uniform random injection (17.69) 略高 (17.73)，\n      因为 code-heavy contamination 在 code domain 上引入更严重的 distributional shift，\n      同时在 general domain 影响较小——overall holdout PPL 反映了这种 domain-imbalanced 退化。\n\n      Adaptive 改善 0.05 PPL (0.28% relative)——与 uniform injection (0.23%) 相当。\n      关键是 b* 的 per-batch 自适应能力：\n      code-heavy batch（contamination 集中）的 b* median 更高 (1.35)，\n      general-domain batch（contamination 稀疏）的 b* 更低 (0.42)。\n      这体现了 per-batch b* 的核心优势——不是对所有数据用同一个 b，\n      而是根据每个 batch 的 contamination 程度动态调整。\n\n      Fixed b 方法在这种 skewed 场景下尤其受限：\n      对 code domain 最优的 b 对 general domain 过度 downweight，反之亦然。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10: Domain-skewed injection results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 11: Per-domain b* distribution (code vs general)——展示 domain-adaptive behavior\"\n      - \"Appendix: Domain-specific PPL breakdown\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-skewed 实验强化了 per-batch b* 的 story：\n      方法不仅追踪 contamination rate 的变化（P0.2），还追踪 contamination 的 domain 分布。\n      这是 \"b is not a hyperparameter — it's a data-driven quantity\" 叙事的最强证据之一。\n      对 reviewer 来说：\"real web corpora have domain-skewed contamination, not uniform injection; adaptive b* handles both.\"\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: p2_downstream_eval\n    description: \"在 3B model checkpoints 上评估下游任务，验证 PPL 改善是否转移。\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_mmlu_acc: 31.8\n      adaptive_mmlu_acc: 32.5\n      mmlu_delta_abs_pct: 0.7\n      mmlu_delta_relative_pct: 2.2\n      uniform_hellaswag_acc: 52.1\n      adaptive_hellaswag_acc: 53.2\n      hellaswag_delta_abs_pct: 1.1\n      hellaswag_delta_relative_pct: 2.1\n      uniform_selfbleu_4gram: 0.42\n      adaptive_selfbleu_4gram: 0.38\n      selfbleu_improvement: 0.04\n      gpu_hours: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 (12.85→12.69, 1.24% relative) 预期部分转移至下游任务。\n\n      MMLU (知识密集型，4-shot)：\n      3B 在 200M tokens 上训练的 MMLU 基线约 31.8%（远未饱和），\n      adaptive 提升至 32.5% (+0.7 abs)。\n      机制：更干净的预训练 → factual knowledge 被更准确地编码，\n      而非被 synthetic data 的 hallucinated facts 干扰。\n      δ=0.7% 在 [0.3, 1.5] 的 best 档范围内。\n\n      HellaSwag (常识推理，0-shot)：\n      Uniform 52.1%，adaptive 53.2% (+1.1 abs)。\n      改善比 MMLU 更大因为 HellaSwag 更依赖 language model quality (sentence completion)，\n      而 PPL 正是 language model quality 的直接度量。\n      δ=1.1% 在 [0.3, 1.5] 范围内偏高，反映 3B 模型上的 amplified effect。\n\n      Self-BLEU (generation diversity)：\n      0.42 → 0.38 (↓0.04)——更低 = 更多样。\n      Adaptive 减少了 synthetic data 导致的 repetitive patterns，生成文本更多样。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: Downstream evaluation (uniform vs adaptive, Llama-3.2-3B)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 12: Downstream task improvement bar chart (MMLU, HellaSwag, Self-BLEU)\"\n      - \"Figure 7: Extended with downstream metrics — model size vs downstream Δ\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPL→downstream 转移验证了方法的实际价值。\n      MMLU +0.7%、HellaSwag +1.1% 绝对改善在 200M tokens 的有限预训练下可观。\n      Self-BLEU 改善进一步证明 adaptive reweighting 减少了 model collapse 征兆（repetitive outputs）。\n\n      Reviewer concern \"does PPL matter for real tasks?\" → 是的，\n      且效应在下游比 PPL 上更可测量（0.7-1.1% absolute vs 1.24% relative PPL），\n      因为下游任务评估了不同维度的模型能力。\n\n      论文表述：\"Adaptive b* improves not only perplexity but also downstream task performance,\n      confirming that the cleaner gradient signal during pretraining transfers to measurable gains\n      in knowledge recall (MMLU +0.7%) and commonsense reasoning (HellaSwag +1.1%).\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9839,"cache_read_input_tokens":27185,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9839},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50e25480-ff86-4d52-8ac3-d97b90843ba0","uuid":"aa2d8bfd-b822-4ca0-8179-516baecf0041"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":687663,"duration_api_ms":688850,"num_turns":4,"result":"Reading the experiment plan for all planned experiments.\n\nNow let me generate the comprehensive best-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Adaptive b* 不仅免调参匹配 grid-best，在多数设置下达到或超过 grid-best。\n  b* 轨迹随污染率/模型规模自适应偏移，证明 α_eff(b) 框架捕捉了正确的统计量。\n  Claim 2 可升级为 \"adaptive matches or exceeds grid-best\"，\n  Claim 1 的理论框架有 b*-tracks-optimum 的直接证据支撑。\n  效应放大数据直接回应 \"small effect size\" 的 reviewer concern。\n  论文可正面 claim: principled, zero-cost, and effective。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.1: b<0.5 Grid Extension\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed42\n    description: \"在 b=0.5 以下扩展 grid 搜索，确认 grid-best 不在搜索边界外。seed42。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.681\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.668\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.654\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.42\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.95\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.1 极其温和的 downweighting 仅比 uniform (17.690) 好 0.009 PPL——大部分合成样本权重仍接近 1.0，几乎无过滤效果。\n      b=0.2 改善至 17.668，因为 w=(1-q)^0.2 对高 q 值样本（synthetic, q≈0.85）的权重降至 (0.15)^0.2≈0.72，开始起效但幅度不足。\n      b=0.3 达到 17.654，与 b=0.5 的 17.651 仅差 0.003，因为在 TF-IDF detector 的 q-score 分布下（bimodal, 中间区域占 46%），\n      b=0.3-0.5 区间的有效样本量 ESS 和 α_eff 都在最优平台内。\n      train_loss 逐步上升因为更高 b 对 contaminated samples 的 loss contribution 压缩更多。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds — seed42 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (b-PPL curve): b=0.1/0.2/0.3 扩展 seed42 曲线左侧，确认 broad minimum 在 b∈[0.3,0.5]\"\n    analysis: >\n      seed42 的 b=0.3 与 b=0.5 差距仅 0.003 PPL，远小于 seed variance (~0.01)。\n      证实 b=0.5 不是边界伪影，最优区间是宽阔的 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed123\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed123，验证跨 seed 一致性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.674\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.656\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.641\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.43\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.96\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.29\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed123 在 MVP 中一贯表现最优（grid-best b=0.5 PPL=17.638 最低），因其随机初始化恰好对 data quality 信号更敏感。\n      b=0.3 的 17.641 与 b=0.5 的 17.638 仅差 0.003，同样在 seed variance 内。\n      与 seed42 一致地确认最优平台而非单一最优点。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed123 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed123 曲线叠加，三条曲线在 b∈[0.3,0.5] 重合验证平台稳定性\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨 seed 一致性：seed123 的 b=0.3 同样在平台内，最优区间 cross-seed 稳定。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456 (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed456\n    description: \"Finer grid 扩展 seed456，完成 3-seed b<0.5 曲线。\"\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_eval_ppl: 17.684\n      b0_2_eval_ppl: 17.670\n      b0_3_eval_ppl: 17.653\n      b0_1_train_loss: 8.40\n      b0_2_train_loss: 8.93\n      b0_3_train_loss: 9.26\n      total_steps: 6103\n      gpu_hours: 10.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed456 在 MVP 中 uniform PPL 略高 (17.700)，对应更大的改善空间。\n      b=0.3 的 17.653 与 b=0.5 的 17.650 仅差 0.003，第三次独立确认 [0.3, 0.5] 平台。\n      所有三个 seed 的 b=0.3 vs b=0.5 差异一致地小于 seed variance (σ≈0.008)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Extended grid-b PPL curve — seed456 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: seed456 曲线完成三 seed 覆盖\"\n    analysis: >\n      3/3 seeds 确认 b=0.3 和 b=0.5 在噪声范围内无显著差异，消除 boundary concern。\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_eval\n    description: \"对 9 个 b<0.5 训练 checkpoint 统一进行 holdout 评估，获取可比的 eval_ppl。\"\n    expected_results:\n      all_9_eval_ppl_collected: true\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_1: 17.680\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_2: 17.665\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_3: 17.649\n      cross_seed_mean_b0_5: 17.646\n      cross_seed_std_b0_3: 0.007\n      cross_seed_std_b0_5: 0.007\n      b0_3_vs_b0_5_paired_t_pvalue: 0.42\n      updated_finer_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      finer_grid_best_b_note: \"b=0.3 within seed variance; b=0.5 retained as grid-best\"\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      统一 post-hoc eval 消除训练时评估条件差异。跨 seed 平均后 b=0.3 (17.649) 与 b=0.5 (17.646) 差异仅 0.003，\n      paired t-test p=0.42 远不显著。这确认 grid-best 仍为 b=0.5（或更准确地说，b∈[0.3,0.5] 是一个无显著差异的最优平台）。\n      关键发现是曲线形态：b=0→0.3 单调下降，b=0.3→0.5 平台，b=0.5→1.0 急剧上升。\n      这种不对称性（慢进快出）解释了为什么 adaptive b* 的 median=0.87 仍然有效——b 偏高 0.4 的 PPL 代价远小于偏低 0.4 的代价。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: 完整 extended grid-b PPL curve (b=0.1...5.0) × 3 seeds — 汇总行\"\n      - \"Table 2 注脚: paired t-test b=0.3 vs b=0.5, p=0.42 (n.s.)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2: 完整 b-PPL 曲线（9 个新数据点 + 18 个 MVP 数据点），标注 [0.3,0.5] 平台区域和 adaptive b* 分布直方图叠加\"\n      - \"Figure 2 inset: 放大 b∈[0,1] 区域的曲线形态，标注 asymmetric penalty structure\"\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 boundary concern 已完全消除。最优区间是 [0.3, 0.5] 宽平台。\n      adaptive b* 的 p25=0.54 恰好落在平台右沿，56% 的 per-batch b* 在 [0.3, 1.5] 区间。\n      结合不对称 penalty structure（偏高 < 偏低的代价），adaptive 的 median=0.87 是合理的保守选择。\n      论文可表述为 \"grid-best is not a single point but a plateau spanning b∈[0.3, 0.5]; adaptive b* allocates the majority of its mass in or near this region.\"\n      更新 aggregate ratio（使用 b=0.5 作为 grid-best，维持 88.6%——finer grid 不改变此数字因为 b=0.5 仍为 grid-best）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.2: 60% Contamination\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6 (Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_datagen\n    description: \"生成 60% 污染率的训练数据集，并用 TF-IDF+LR detector 进行评分。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scored_data_ready: true\n      contamination_ratio_actual: 0.60\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      q_score_mean: 0.68\n      q_score_std: 0.35\n      q_score_median: 0.78\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.41\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.936\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 3.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染率意味着更多高 q-score 样本。q_score_mean 从 40% 的 0.60 升至 0.68，median 从 0.707 升至 0.78，\n      因为 synthetic 样本占比增大推高了分布的上半部分。\n      detector AUC 略降至 0.936（vs 40% 的 0.939），因为 60% 意味着 class imbalance 从 40:60 变为 60:40，\n      TF-IDF 在 prevalence shift 下 AUC 微降但仍 >0.93。\n      mid_range_ratio (q∈[0.2,0.8]) 从 0.463 降至 0.41，因为更多样本被推向高 q 区域。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score 分布对比图 (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)，标注 median 和 mean shift\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据质量验证：60% 的 q-score 分布如预期偏移，detector 在不同 prevalence 下保持 AUC >0.93。\n      mid_range 比例下降意味着更多样本的 contamination status 是明确的（高 q 或低 q），\n      有利于 adaptive b* 的 α_eff 估计精度。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_uniform\n    description: \"60% 污染率下的 uniform 基线，作为效应放大的参考点。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.92\n      eval_loss: 2.886\n      train_loss: 7.48\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12000\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      从 40% (17.690) 到 60% uniform PPL 上升至 17.92 (+0.23 PPL, +1.3%)。\n      更多合成数据意味着 60% 的梯度来自被 generate model 统计特性扭曲的文本，\n      累积的分布偏移导致 model 对 clean holdout distribution 的拟合退化。\n      上升幅度非线性：40% 时 PPL 比 clean (~17.45 估计) 高 0.24，60% 时高 0.47。\n      这符合 strong model collapse 文献的预测——污染效应超线性增长。\n      train_loss 略高于 40% 的 7.31 因为合成数据的 loss landscape 更平坦。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Contamination scaling (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6) — Uniform 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Contamination rate vs PPL bar chart — uniform 系列\"\n    analysis: >\n      60% uniform PPL 比 40% 差 0.23 PPL，确认 contamination 对模型质量的负面影响随比例非线性增大。\n      这为 effect amplification argument 建立了必要的 baseline gap。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_adaptive\n    description: \"60% 污染下的 adaptive b*，验证效应放大 + b* 轨迹追踪。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.73\n      eval_loss: 2.875\n      train_loss: 7.92\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 11500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.19\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 1.06\n      effect_amplification_vs_40pct: 4.75\n      b_star_mean: 2.08\n      b_star_median: 1.42\n      b_star_std: 2.45\n      b_star_p25: 0.82\n      b_star_p75: 2.55\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 12.3\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 24.8\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 32.1\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 30.8\n      ratio_vs_grid_b0_5: 111.8\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      核心结果：PPL 从 17.92 (uniform) 降至 17.73，改善 0.19 PPL (1.06% relative)。\n      对比 40% 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%)，效应放大 4.75x——在 [3, 5] 的 best 档范围内。\n\n      效应放大的因果链：\n      1) 60% 污染 → 每个 batch 中 ~60% 样本需要 downweight（vs 40%）\n      2) 更多 contaminated samples → α_eff(b) 的 Pareto tail 更重 → b* 自然上调以维持 ESS\n      3) 更高 b* → 对 synthetic samples 的 gradient contribution 压缩更彻底\n      4) 有效训练信号中 clean data 占比提高 → holdout PPL 改善更大\n\n      b* 分布右移：median 从 0.87 (40%) 升至 1.42 (60%)，mean 从 1.40 升至 2.08。\n      这是 b*-tracks-optimum 的直接证据——当 contamination 增加时，adaptive 框架自动推高 b* 以匹配新的最优区域。\n      p25 从 0.54 升至 0.82 意味着即使最低四分位也不再落在 40% 的最优平台 [0.3, 0.5] 内，\n      而是适应性地转向 60% 的更高最优区间。\n\n      ratio_vs_grid_b0_5 = 111.8%：adaptive 的 0.19 PPL 改善超过 grid b=0.5 在 60% 下的预期改善 (0.10)。\n      这是因为 b=0.5 在 60% 下已不再最优——contamination 增加要求更高的 b，\n      而 adaptive 自动追踪到了更优的 b 区间，grid b=0.5 做不到。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Contamination scaling — Adaptive 行\"\n      - \"Table 4: b* distribution summary across settings (40% vs 60%)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: Effect amplification — adaptive 改善量 bar，标注 4.75x amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution histograms side-by-side (ρ=0.4 vs ρ=0.6)，标注 median shift 0.87→1.42\"\n      - \"Figure 5: b* trajectory over training steps at ρ=0.6，与 ρ=0.4 对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 best 档的核心证据之一。两个关键 takeaway：\n      (1) Effect amplification 4.75x 直接回应 \"small effect size\" 的 reviewer concern——\n      0.3% → 1.06% 的 relative improvement 在 60% 条件下已不再 \"small\"，且趋势表明更高污染下价值更大。\n      (2) b* median shift 从 0.87 到 1.42 是 α_eff(b) 框架 captured the right statistics 的硬证据。\n      b* 不是固定的超参数——它是数据驱动的自适应量，且其自适应方向与 grid-optimal shift 一致。\n      这支撑 Claim 1（理论框架有效性）和 Claim 2 的升级（\"matches or exceeds\"）。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\n    description: \"用 40% 最优的 b=0.5 在 60% 下运行，展示 fixed-b 在 contamination shift 下的退化。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.83\n      eval_loss: 2.881\n      train_loss: 9.72\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12500\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.09\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.50\n      ratio_of_60_vs_40_improvement: 2.25\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 污染下仍优于 uniform (17.83 vs 17.92, 改善 0.09 PPL)，但改善量仅为\n      adaptive 在同条件下 (0.19 PPL) 的 47%。\n\n      原因：b=0.5 在 60% 下 \"太温和\"。对 synthetic samples (q≈0.85)，w=(1-0.85)^0.5≈0.39，\n      这在 40% 污染时足够（只需轻度过滤 40% 的数据），但在 60% 污染时不够——\n      60% 的梯度仍有 39% 的权重，过滤力度不足。\n      grid-optimal 在 60% 约为 b=1.5（对应 w=(0.15)^1.5≈0.058，几乎完全过滤 synthetic gradient）。\n\n      这个实验的价值在于直接展示 fixed-b 跨条件迁移的失败：\n      40% 的 grid-best 不是 60% 的 grid-best。\n      如果使用 Drayson 的 validation-based b 选择，需要在 60% 条件下重新做 grid search。\n      Adaptive b* 自动处理了这个迁移。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Contamination scaling — Grid b=0.5 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: bar chart 中 grid b=0.5 在 60% 下的 bar 显著低于 adaptive\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 adaptive vs fixed-b 对比的关键证据。b=0.5 在 40% 是最优的，在 60% 沦为次优。\n      adaptive b* 无需 re-tuning 就适应了新条件。\n      论文表述：\"\"A fixed b tuned for one contamination level does not transfer; adaptive b* adapts automatically.\"\"\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.3: Cross-Model (Llama-3.2-3B)\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_setup\n    description: \"下载 Llama-3.2-3B，生成 detector scores，准备训练数据。\"\n    expected_results:\n      model_downloaded: true\n      model_params_B: 3.21\n      vram_usage_estimate_GB: 72\n      gradient_checkpointing_needed: true\n      effective_batch_size: 16\n      micro_batch_size: 4\n      gradient_accumulation_steps: 4\n      detector_scores_reused: true\n      detector_note: \"Same TF-IDF+LR detector scores (text-based, model-agnostic)\"\n      setup_gpu_hours: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-3B 约 3.2B 参数，FP16 下占 ~6.4GB 模型权重，但训练时 optimizer states + gradients + activations\n      需要 ~65-72GB。4× RTX 6000 Pro 96GB 可用 DDP，单卡 batch_size=4 + gradient_accumulation=4\n      达到 effective batch_size=16（与 0.6B 一致，保证可比性）。\n\n      TF-IDF+LR detector scores 可复用——detector 基于文本特征（词频 + 逻辑回归），\n      与训练模型架构无关。这也符合 Claim 3 (unknown proportion) 的设定。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      环境就绪。关键设计决策：保持 effective batch_size=16 以确保 b* 分布可直接与 0.6B 对比。\n      gradient checkpointing 增加约 20% 训练时间但不影响收敛。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_uniform\n    description: \"3B 模型的 uniform 基线。预期比 0.6B 低得多的 PPL（更强模型）。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.85\n      eval_loss: 2.554\n      train_loss: 5.89\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 38000\n      gpu_hours: 11.5\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型在 200M tokens 上训练后 holdout PPL 约 12.85——显著低于 0.6B 的 17.69。\n      PPL 降低来自更大的模型容量：更多参数可以更好地建模语言分布。\n      但 40% synthetic contamination 仍在拖累：clean 3B PPL 估计约 12.50，\n      contamination 导致 0.35 PPL degradation (~2.7%)——比 0.6B 的 1.4% degradation 更大，\n      因为 3B 模型有更多参数来\"记忆\"合成数据的 distributional artifacts。\n\n      train_runtime 约 38000s (10.5h)：3B 的每步计算量约为 0.6B 的 5.3x，\n      但 gradient checkpointing 的 recompute 增加约 20% overhead。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: Cross-model results (Qwen3-0.6B vs Llama-3.2-3B) — Uniform 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: Cross-model comparison bar chart — uniform baselines\"\n    analysis: >\n      3B uniform PPL 12.85 确立了 cross-model 基线。\n      contamination degradation 比例 (2.7%) 大于 0.6B (1.4%)，预示 reweighting 的效益更大。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_adaptive\n    description: \"3B 模型上的 adaptive b*——验证跨模型规模泛化 + 效应放大。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 12.69\n      eval_loss: 2.541\n      train_loss: 6.12\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 39500\n      gpu_hours: 12.0\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.16\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 1.24\n      effect_amplification_vs_06B: 5.39\n      b_star_mean: 1.41\n      b_star_median: 0.88\n      b_star_std: 1.97\n      b_star_p25: 0.54\n      b_star_p75: 1.53\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 20.8\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 35.6\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 27.4\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 16.2\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 0.16 (12.85→12.69, 1.24% relative)——是 0.6B 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%) 的 5.4x 放大。\n\n      效应放大的机制：\n      (1) 3B 的更大容量使其对 data quality 更敏感——更多参数 = 更精细地适配训练分布，\n      因此 clean vs contaminated distribution 的差异被放大\n      (2) 3B 在 contaminated samples 上学到更强的 spurious patterns（更高的 memorization capacity），\n      reweighting 的去除效果更显著\n      (3) clean data 的信号在 3B 上被更充分地利用（0.6B 可能 capacity-bound，无法完全受益于更干净的梯度）\n\n      b* 分布几乎与 0.6B 完全一致（median 0.88 vs 0.87, mean 1.41 vs 1.40）——\n      这是因为 b* 仅从 per-batch q-score 统计量推导，与模型架构/规模无关。\n      同一数据 + 同一 detector + 同一 batch composition = 同一 b*。\n      但同样的 b* 在 3B 上产生更大的 PPL 改善——b* 的 universal applicability 是最强的 selling point。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: Cross-model results — Adaptive 行\"\n      - \"Table 4: b* distribution summary — Llama-3.2-3B 列（与 Qwen3-0.6B 并列）\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: Cross-model bar chart — adaptive bars 标注 5.4x amplification\"\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution overlay (0.6B vs 3B)——几乎完全重合，标注 KL divergence ≈ 0\"\n      - \"Figure 7: Scatter plot — model size vs relative PPL improvement, 标注 scaling trend\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个层面的强证据：\n      (1) 效应放大 5.4x 彻底回应 \"small effect size\"——1.24% relative PPL improvement on 3B is substantial\n      (2) b* 分布跨模型规模完全一致——证明方法是 model-agnostic，b* 是数据属性而非模型属性\n      (3) 无需 per-model validation——Drayson 在 1.7B 用 b=1 vs ≤360M 用 b=10，需要 per-model tuning；\n      我们的 adaptive b* 跨 0.6B 和 3B 自动给出一致且有效的值\n\n      Claim 2 在 3B 上的 ratio 计算：\n      若 grid-best for 3B 也约 b=0.5 (同一数据)，grid-best PPL ≈ 12.71，\n      则 ratio = (12.85-12.69)/(12.85-12.71) = 0.16/0.14 = 114.3%。\n      Adaptive 超过 grid-best——因为 per-batch b* 在高 contamination batches 用更高 b，\n      在 clean batches 用低 b，优于任何 fixed b。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.4: n_min Sensitivity\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_1\n    description: \"极松的 ESS 约束 (n_min=1)——允许 b* 过高，可能 over-downweight。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.668\n      eval_loss: 2.873\n      train_loss: 7.85\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10400\n      b_star_mean: 2.95\n      b_star_median: 1.73\n      b_star_std: 3.82\n      b_star_p25: 0.71\n      b_star_p75: 3.45\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 12.8\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 允许 ESS 降至 1（即一个 batch 中理论上只需 1 个有效样本）。\n      这释放了 b* 的上限约束——α_eff(b) 的最大化不再受 ESS 限制，b* 可以飙到很高值。\n\n      结果是 b* 分布大幅右移：median 1.73 (vs n_min=2 的 0.87)，12.8% 的 batches b*>5。\n      在这些高 b* batches 中，几乎所有 contaminated samples 权重趋近于零，\n      有效只有 1-2 个 clean samples 贡献梯度——gradient variance 极高。\n\n      PPL 17.668：比 n_min=2 的 17.650 差 0.018，但仍优于 uniform 17.690 (改善 0.022)。\n      方法没有彻底崩溃，因为多数 batches 的 b* 仍在合理范围 (p25=0.71)，\n      只有极端 batches 出问题。这说明 n_min 在保护方法稳定性上是必要但阈值不需精确。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: n_min sensitivity ablation (n_min = 1, 2, 3, 4, 5)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: n_min vs eval_ppl curve — n_min=1 点标注 'over-aggressive'\"\n      - \"Figure 8 inset: b* distribution comparison across n_min values\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 验证了 ESS 约束的必要性：无约束下 b* 过高导致 gradient variance 增大，\n      PPL 退化但不崩溃 (仍优于 uniform)。\n      这支持 n_min=2 作为 sweet spot 的选择——既足够宽松允许有效 downweighting，\n      又足够紧来防止极端 over-filtering。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_4\n    description: \"n_min=batch_size → ESS 约束要求所有样本保持有效 → b* 被强制为 0。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.873\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      当 n_min = batch_size = 4 时（micro-batch for DDP, per-GPU），ESS 约束要求\n      每个 batch 的有效样本量 ≥ batch_size。由于 ESS 定义为 (Σw_i)²/Σw_i²，\n      对于 w=(1-q)^b，任何 b>0 都会降低 contaminated samples 的权重，\n      从而使 ESS < batch_size。因此 b* 被强制钳制为 0。\n\n      PPL = 17.690，与 uniform (17.690) 完全一致——验证了当 ESS 约束完全绑定时\n      算法正确退化为 uniform training。train_loss 也与 uniform 一致 (7.31)。\n\n      这是一个 sanity check：证明 adaptive b* 的改善确实来自非零的 b*（即 reweighting），\n      而非算法实现中的其他副作用（如 batch shuffling, gradient scaling 等）。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: n_min sensitivity — n_min=4 行，标注 '=uniform'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: n_min=4 点与 uniform baseline 重合\"\n    analysis: >\n      完美的退化验证。n_min=4 → b*=0 → uniform，PPL 精确匹配。\n      这排除了任何 confounding factor，确认改善纯粹来自 adaptive reweighting signal。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_5\n    description: \"n_min > batch_size 的退化情况。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.690\n      eval_loss: 2.873\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10300\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_zero: 100.0\n      equivalent_to_uniform: true\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4，ESS 约束不可能被满足（ESS 上限为 batch_size=4 < n_min=5），\n      因此 b* 始终被钳制为 0。结果与 n_min=4 完全相同——uniform training。\n\n      这是 boundary case 验证。n_min > batch_size 在实践中没有意义，\n      但作为 ablation 的一端提供完整的 sensitivity curve。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: n_min sensitivity — n_min=5 行，标注 'degenerate'\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 8: n_min=5 与 n_min=4 重合在 uniform baseline\"\n    analysis: >\n      与 n_min=4 一致的退化行为。完整 ablation 展示清晰的 phase transition：\n      n_min=1 (over-aggressive) → n_min=2 (optimal) → n_min=3 (fragile, seed-dependent) → n_min≥4 (degenerate/uniform)。\n      结合 MVP 已有数据 (n_min=2: 17.650, n_min=3: 17.690 for seed42)，\n      sensitivity curve 有 4 个有效数据点 + 1 个 degenerate 确认。\n      n_min=2 是唯一稳定工作的值——但这不是 \"another hyperparameter to tune\"，\n      而是一个有明确物理含义的约束（\"每 batch 至少 2 个有效样本\"），\n      且 robustness window 为 n_min∈{1,2}（两个值都 > uniform）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: ENHANCE PAPER\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_modernbert\n    description: \"训练高 AUC detector (ModernBERT-150M) 并生成训练集的 q-scores。\"\n    expected_results:\n      detector_auc: 0.986\n      detector_accuracy: 0.961\n      detector_ece_calibrated: 0.022\n      temperature_T: 0.85\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.40\n      q_score_median: 0.72\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.28\n      training_gpu_hours: 1.8\n      scoring_gpu_hours: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT (150M params) 的 AUC 达 0.986（vs TF-IDF 的 0.939），\n      因为 transformer 可以捕捉 n-gram 之外的语义一致性和 generation artifacts。\n      calibrated ECE 0.022 (vs TF-IDF 0.048) 因为模型输出 logit 的温度校准更精确。\n\n      关键差异在 q-score 分布：mid_range_ratio 仅 0.28 (vs TF-IDF 0.463)。\n      ModernBERT 将更多样本推向极端（要么 q≈0 (confident real) 要么 q≈1 (confident synthetic)），\n      中间地带大幅缩小。这意味着 w=(1-q)^b 的权重更接近 binary (0 or 1)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Detector comparison (TF-IDF+LR vs ModernBERT)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Figure: q-score 分布对比 (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)——ModernBERT 更 bimodal\"\n    analysis: >\n      ModernBERT 的更高 AUC 和更 bimodal 的 q-score 分布将显著改变 b* 的行为。\n      mid_range_ratio 降至 0.28 意味着 adaptive b* 的空间被压缩——\n      多数样本的 (1-q)^b 对 b 的敏感度降低（接近 0 或 1）。\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_ablation_training\n    description: \"用 ModernBERT q-scores 训练 adaptive + uniform，量化 detector quality → PPL 关系。\"\n    expected_results:\n      modernbert_adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.638\n      modernbert_uniform_eval_ppl: 17.690\n      modernbert_adaptive_improvement: 0.052\n      modernbert_adaptive_relative_pct: 0.29\n      tfidf_adaptive_improvement: 0.040\n      improvement_ratio_modernbert_vs_tfidf: 1.30\n      modernbert_b_star_mean: 0.82\n      modernbert_b_star_median: 0.45\n      modernbert_b_star_std: 1.15\n      modernbert_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      modernbert_grid_best_ppl: 17.634\n      modernbert_adaptive_ratio: 96.3\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      更高 AUC detector → 更精确的 q-scores → 更准确的 reweighting → 更低的 PPL。\n      ModernBERT adaptive PPL 17.638 vs TF-IDF adaptive 17.650，改善 0.012 PPL。\n      相对改善量从 0.040 (TF-IDF) 增至 0.052 (ModernBERT)，提升 30%。\n\n      但关键 finding 是：这个 30% 提升对应 AUC 从 0.939 到 0.986 的差距 (0.047 AUC)，\n      边际收益递减。TF-IDF (AUC=0.939) 已捕获了大部分 reweighting value。\n\n      b* 分布因 q-score 更 bimodal 而更窄更低：median 0.45 (vs TF-IDF 0.87)。\n      这是因为 ModernBERT 的 q 值更极端，(1-q)^b 的权重区分在低 b 就已足够。\n      adaptive 框架自动适应了 detector 质量的差异——这本身就是 adaptivity 的体现。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: Detector quality ablation — 训练结果列\"\n      - \"Table 4: b* distribution — ModernBERT 列\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 9: Detector AUC vs PPL improvement scatter/bar chart\"\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distributions under different detectors (TF-IDF vs ModernBERT)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Two findings for paper:\n      (1) Lightweight detector sufficiency：TF-IDF+LR (AUC=0.939) 已实现 77% 的 ModernBERT (AUC=0.986) reweighting value，\n      但成本仅为后者的 1/100（CPU 训练 vs GPU 微调 150M transformer）。\n      (2) Adaptive b* detector-agnostic：方法在两种截然不同的 detector 下都有效工作，\n      b* 分布自动适应 q-score 分布特性。\n      这强化了 Claim 1（方法的 principled nature）和实用性论证。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_datagen\n    description: \"用不同模型家族生成合成数据，测试 cross-generator robustness。\"\n    expected_results:\n      generator_model: \"Llama-3.2-1B\"\n      training_model: \"Qwen3-0.6B\"\n      contamination_ratio: 0.4\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      detector_auc_cross_gen: 0.952\n      detector_accuracy_cross_gen: 0.873\n      q_score_mean: 0.62\n      q_score_std: 0.38\n      q_score_median: 0.73\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.44\n      datagen_gpu_hours: 7.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.2-1B 生成的 synthetic text 与 Qwen3-0.6B 生成的有不同的 stylistic signatures。\n      TF-IDF+LR detector 在 cross-generator 场景下 AUC 提高至 0.952 (vs same-generator 0.939)——\n      因为跨模型族的 generation artifacts 更容易被 n-gram 特征区分\n      （Llama 和 Qwen 有不同的 tokenizer、训练数据、生成模式）。\n\n      q-score 分布略有不同：mean 0.62 (vs 0.60)，median 0.73 (vs 0.707)。\n      Llama 生成的文本被检测器更 confidently 识别为 synthetic，对应稍高的 q 值。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix: q-score distribution comparison (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-generator 数据准备就绪。detector 在 cross-generator 场景下自然表现更好，\n      因为跨模型族的 artifacts 差异更大。这是一个 favorable setup，\n      但也反映了 real-world 场景（web corpus 含多个生成器的输出）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_training\n    description: \"用 Llama 生成的 contaminated data 训练 Qwen3-0.6B，测试 adaptive 跨生成器鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      cross_gen_uniform_ppl: 17.72\n      cross_gen_adaptive_ppl: 17.67\n      cross_gen_improvement: 0.05\n      cross_gen_relative_pct: 0.28\n      cross_gen_b_star_mean: 1.32\n      cross_gen_b_star_median: 0.83\n      cross_gen_b_star_std: 1.86\n      same_gen_improvement_for_ref: 0.04\n      cross_gen_vs_same_gen_ratio: 1.25\n      gpu_hours: 7.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-generator contamination 的 uniform PPL (17.72) 比 same-generator (17.69) 略高——\n      Llama-generated text 的 distributional distance 与 Qwen training 的 mismatch 更大。\n\n      Adaptive 改善 0.05 PPL (0.28% relative)，与 same-generator 的 0.04 PPL (0.23%) 相当甚至略好。\n      改善略大因为 cross-generator 的 contamination 更容易检测 (AUC=0.952 vs 0.939)，\n      q-scores 更 discriminative → reweighting 更精确。\n\n      b* 分布与 same-generator 高度一致 (median 0.83 vs 0.87)，\n      证明 adaptive 框架不依赖于特定生成器的 q-score 特征。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Cross-generator results (same-gen vs cross-gen)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: b* distribution comparison (same-gen vs cross-gen)——高度重合\"\n    analysis: >\n      Adaptive b* 在跨生成器场景下稳定工作，改善量与 same-generator 一致。\n      这验证了 Claim 3 的扩展：方法不仅不需要已知污染比例，\n      也不需要知道 contamination 来源模型——只需 detector scores 即可。\n      论文可以表述为 \"generator-agnostic: adaptive works regardless of the source of synthetic contamination.\"\n\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_detect_remove\n    description: \"硬阈值过滤 baseline——q>0.5 的样本直接丢弃。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.668\n      eval_loss: 2.8725\n      train_loss: 6.85\n      total_steps: 3540\n      retained_data_fraction: 0.537\n      retained_tokens: 107400000\n      ppl_improvement_over_uniform: 0.022\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.12\n      improvement_fraction_of_adaptive: 0.55\n      gpu_hours: 2.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      q>0.5 阈值移除 46.3% 的数据（mid_range + high-q 部分）。\n      仅保留 53.7% 的训练 token (~107M)，total_steps 从 6103 降至 ~3540。\n\n      PPL 17.668——优于 uniform (17.690, -0.022) 但逊于 adaptive (17.650, 差 +0.018)。\n      改善量仅为 adaptive 的 55%。\n\n      原因有二：\n      (1) 数据损失：detector 不完美 (AUC=0.939)，mid_range 中有大量 clean-but-borderline 样本被错误移除。\n      移除 46% 数据意味着训练集有效缩减近半，loss of coverage 影响 language model 的 distributional coverage。\n      (2) 丧失细粒度：hard threshold 是 binary 决策，而 adaptive reweighting 保留了 gradient-level 的连续控制。\n      q=0.48 (刚好保留) 和 q=0.52 (刚好移除) 的样本被处理方式截然不同，但其实它们的 contamination 概率差异极小。\n\n      train_loss 低于其他方法因为数据更干净（移除了大部分 noisy samples）但数据量也更少。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Baseline comparison (uniform, grid-best, adaptive, detect-remove, random-reweight)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Baseline comparison bar chart — detect-and-remove 标注 data loss penalty\"\n    analysis: >\n      Detect-and-remove 的 0.12% PPL 改善仅为 adaptive 的 55%，\n      清晰展示 soft reweighting 优于 hard filtering。\n      关键 insight：在 imperfect detector 下 (AUC<1.0)，\n      连续权重比二元决策更能容忍检测误差。\n      This directly supports the \"loss reweighting > SIR resampling\" positioning vs Drayson。\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_random_reweight\n    description: \"随机权重 baseline——验证 detector signal 是 load-bearing 的。\"\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      eval_loss: 2.874\n      train_loss: 7.28\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 10400\n      ppl_vs_uniform: -0.005\n      ppl_vs_adaptive: -0.045\n      random_weight_mean: 0.5\n      random_weight_std: 0.29\n      gpu_hours: 3.4\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重 (i.i.d. uniform [0,1]) 不含任何 contamination signal。\n      PPL 17.695 与 uniform 17.690 几乎无差异 (差 0.005, <0.03% relative)——\n      随机噪声在 expectation 上等价于 uniform weighting，仅增加少量 gradient variance。\n\n      微弱的退化 (0.005 PPL 劣于 uniform) 来自随机权重引入的 gradient variance：\n      高权重 batch 和低权重 batch 的 loss 贡献不均衡，增加了 optimization 的随机性。\n      但效应极小，证明 reweighting 本身不有害（只要权重均值合理）。\n\n      与 adaptive 的 0.045 PPL 差距证明：adaptive 的改善 100% 来自 detector-informed weighting，\n      不是来自 \"任何形式的 reweighting 都有帮助\" 的偏见。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: Baseline comparison — Random reweight 行\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 10: Random reweight bar 与 uniform 重合，凸显 adaptive 的 detector-driven gap\"\n    analysis: >\n      最清晰的 ablation 之一：random reweight ≈ uniform → detector signal 是必要条件。\n      adaptive 的改善不是来自 \"diversity of weights\" 或 \"regularization effect\"，\n      而是精准地识别和 downweight contaminated samples。\n      论文必须 include 此 baseline 以消除 trivial explanation。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: IF GPU BUDGET ALLOWS\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p2_domain_skewed\n    description: \"合成数据集中注入 code/technical 域，测试 adaptive 在非均匀域分布下的鲁棒性。\"\n    expected_results:\n      contamination_distribution: \"70% code, 20% technical/science, 10% general\"\n      uniform_eval_ppl: 17.73\n      adaptive_eval_ppl: 17.68\n      adaptive_improvement: 0.05\n      relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.28\n      b_star_mean: 1.52\n      b_star_median: 0.95\n      b_star_std: 2.12\n      b_star_per_domain_code_median: 1.35\n      b_star_per_domain_general_median: 0.42\n      gpu_hours: 6.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Domain-skewed contamination（70% code）使 uniform PPL 比 uniform random injection (17.69) 略高 (17.73)，\n      因为 code-heavy contamination 在 code domain 上引入更严重的 distributional shift，\n      同时在 general domain 影响较小——overall holdout PPL 反映了这种 domain-imbalanced 退化。\n\n      Adaptive 改善 0.05 PPL (0.28% relative)——与 uniform injection (0.23%) 相当。\n      关键是 b* 的 per-batch 自适应能力：\n      code-heavy batch（contamination 集中）的 b* median 更高 (1.35)，\n      general-domain batch（contamination 稀疏）的 b* 更低 (0.42)。\n      这体现了 per-batch b* 的核心优势——不是对所有数据用同一个 b，\n      而是根据每个 batch 的 contamination 程度动态调整。\n\n      Fixed b 方法在这种 skewed 场景下尤其受限：\n      对 code domain 最优的 b 对 general domain 过度 downweight，反之亦然。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10: Domain-skewed injection results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 11: Per-domain b* distribution (code vs general)——展示 domain-adaptive behavior\"\n      - \"Appendix: Domain-specific PPL breakdown\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain-skewed 实验强化了 per-batch b* 的 story：\n      方法不仅追踪 contamination rate 的变化（P0.2），还追踪 contamination 的 domain 分布。\n      这是 \"b is not a hyperparameter — it's a data-driven quantity\" 叙事的最强证据之一。\n      对 reviewer 来说：\"real web corpora have domain-skewed contamination, not uniform injection; adaptive b* handles both.\"\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: p2_downstream_eval\n    description: \"在 3B model checkpoints 上评估下游任务，验证 PPL 改善是否转移。\"\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_mmlu_acc: 31.8\n      adaptive_mmlu_acc: 32.5\n      mmlu_delta_abs_pct: 0.7\n      mmlu_delta_relative_pct: 2.2\n      uniform_hellaswag_acc: 52.1\n      adaptive_hellaswag_acc: 53.2\n      hellaswag_delta_abs_pct: 1.1\n      hellaswag_delta_relative_pct: 2.1\n      uniform_selfbleu_4gram: 0.42\n      adaptive_selfbleu_4gram: 0.38\n      selfbleu_improvement: 0.04\n      gpu_hours: 1.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      PPL 改善 (12.85→12.69, 1.24% relative) 预期部分转移至下游任务。\n\n      MMLU (知识密集型，4-shot)：\n      3B 在 200M tokens 上训练的 MMLU 基线约 31.8%（远未饱和），\n      adaptive 提升至 32.5% (+0.7 abs)。\n      机制：更干净的预训练 → factual knowledge 被更准确地编码，\n      而非被 synthetic data 的 hallucinated facts 干扰。\n      δ=0.7% 在 [0.3, 1.5] 的 best 档范围内。\n\n      HellaSwag (常识推理，0-shot)：\n      Uniform 52.1%，adaptive 53.2% (+1.1 abs)。\n      改善比 MMLU 更大因为 HellaSwag 更依赖 language model quality (sentence completion)，\n      而 PPL 正是 language model quality 的直接度量。\n      δ=1.1% 在 [0.3, 1.5] 范围内偏高，反映 3B 模型上的 amplified effect。\n\n      Self-BLEU (generation diversity)：\n      0.42 → 0.38 (↓0.04)——更低 = 更多样。\n      Adaptive 减少了 synthetic data 导致的 repetitive patterns，生成文本更多样。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: Downstream evaluation (uniform vs adaptive, Llama-3.2-3B)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 12: Downstream task improvement bar chart (MMLU, HellaSwag, Self-BLEU)\"\n      - \"Figure 7: Extended with downstream metrics — model size vs downstream Δ\"\n    analysis: >\n      PPL→downstream 转移验证了方法的实际价值。\n      MMLU +0.7%、HellaSwag +1.1% 绝对改善在 200M tokens 的有限预训练下可观。\n      Self-BLEU 改善进一步证明 adaptive reweighting 减少了 model collapse 征兆（repetitive outputs）。\n\n      Reviewer concern \"does PPL matter for real tasks?\" → 是的，\n      且效应在下游比 PPL 上更可测量（0.7-1.1% absolute vs 1.24% relative PPL），\n      因为下游任务评估了不同维度的模型能力。\n\n      论文表述：\"Adaptive b* improves not only perplexity but also downstream task performance,\n      confirming that the cleaner gradient signal during pretraining transfers to measurable gains\n      in knowledge recall (MMLU +0.7%) and commonsense reasoning (HellaSwag +1.1%).\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"50e25480-ff86-4d52-8ac3-d97b90843ba0","total_cost_usd":1.05182125,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25183,"cache_read_input_tokens":65833,"output_tokens":34058,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25183,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":33807,"cache_read_input_tokens":27185,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9839,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9839},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":9926,"outputTokens":23,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.010041000000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":34058,"cacheReadInputTokens":65833,"cacheCreationInputTokens":25183,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.04178025,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"afd56adc-ccf6-41fc-8f1b-2b356ed8df90"}
